      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-04_WidnesExaminer_art0010" n="art0010">
        <head>FOR EVERYTHING</head>
        <p>FOR EVERYTHING</p>
        <p>Tel. No. 123. ESTABLISHED 60 YEARS (in Warrington). Tel. No. 123. E. Forshaw &amp; Son, Ltd., ENGINEERS, BOILERMAKERS, IRON &amp; BRASS FOUNDERS,</p>
        <p>Mersey Boiler Works, Mersey Street, Warrington. Makers of IRON CASTINGS from the smallest size up to 20 tons weight. Clean Well-moulded and of the Highest Quality. To buy the best finished castings is to • frequently save so per cent. in labour.</p>
        <p>RASS CASTINGS (any weight) ; Gunmetal, Copper, Aluminium, Phosphor Bronze, Damaxine, Acid Proof Metal and all other Alloys.</p>
        <p>CONSTRUCTIONAL IRON AND STEEL WORK, Corrugated Iron -Roofs and Buildings, Farmers' Hay Sheds, Barns, Store Sheds, &amp;c., Iron and Steel Tanks, Cisterns, Stoem Jacketted Pans, Boilers, &amp;c. Repairs by Experienced and Skilled Workmen to all kinds of Machinery and to Steam Boilers, Gas Engines, Traction Engines, Motor Cars, Dynamos, Steam Engines, Oil Engines, Road Rollers, Motor Waggons, Electric Motors, ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING. Speciality Work. Drawings and expert advice submitted free.</p>
        <p>Heavy Machining and Forging done for the trade. Turning up to 15 feet diameter. Planing up to 5 feet square. Slotting up to 18-inch stroke. Milling, Punching, Shearing and Bending, Pressing, Dishing, Fangling and Rivetting by hydraulic pressure. Unlimited Tackle and Special Appliances for efficiently dealing with Repairs and Breakdown work, accumulated during an establihsment of 60 years.</p>
      </div>
