        <p>A MONEY PRIZE EVERY WEEK.</p>
        <p>The photo prize scheme originated by the "Examiner" last season proved so popular a feature that we have decided to continue it this season.</p>
        <p>commENeING TO,DaY, PHOTOS OF THE CROWD will be taken every Saturday by the " Examiner" photographer, and repro- duced in the paper the following week. As before, the person distinguished by the mark of the X will receive a cash prize on bringing his " Examiner " to the office in Bewsey-street on or before the SATURDAY following.</p>
